  "rootCauses": [
    "The endpoint alternated the stop list and the geocoder list by position with no relevance check, stop first.",
    "With no full match the stop search falls back to stops sharing any two query words; a house number and a city were enough, and '5' counted as found in '55'.",
    "The feed's abbreviation for central bus stations was expanded only to the construct form, so the spoken form found only stops that spell it out."
  ],
